---
import LegalLayout from '../layouts/LegalLayout.astro';
import { SITE } from '../data/site';
---
<LegalLayout
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description="What personal data Magiapix collects, how we use it and the choices you have."
  updated="November 19, 2026"
  intro="We respect your privacy. This policy explains what information we collect, why we collect it and how we keep it safe."
>
  <h2>Information we collect</h2>
  <p>When you contact us or work with us, we may collect:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>your name and email address;</li>
    <li>your company name;</li>
    <li>details about your project;</li>
    <li>anything else you choose to send us by email or through a form.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>How we use it</h2>
  <p>We use this information to:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>reply to your questions;</li>
    <li>plan, manage and deliver your project;</li>
    <li>improve our services and this website;</li>
    <li>send you project updates or other messages you asked for.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>How we protect it</h2>
  <p>We use reasonable technical and organisational measures to protect your data against loss, misuse and unauthorised access. Only people who need your data to do their work can see it.</p>

  <h2>Sharing</h2>
  <p>We never sell your personal data.</p>
  <p>We share it only with trusted providers we need to run our work, such as email, analytics and project-management tools, and only as much as the task requires.</p>

  <h2>Cookies and analytics</h2>
  <p>This website may use cookies and analytics to see how visitors use it, so we can make it faster and easier to use.</p>
  <p>You can block or delete cookies in your browser settings at any time.</p>

  <h2>Third-party providers</h2>
  <p>Services such as our hosting, analytics and email providers may process data under their own privacy policies. We choose providers that protect personal data properly.</p>

  <h2>Your rights</h2>
  <p>You can ask us to:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>show you the personal data we hold about you;</li>
    <li>correct data that is wrong or incomplete;</li>
    <li>delete your data.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>To make a request, email us at the address below.</p>

  <h2>How long we keep data</h2>
  <p>We keep personal data only as long as we need it for the purposes above, or as long as the law requires.</p>

  <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
  <p>We may update this policy. The date at the top of this page shows the latest version.</p>

  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>Questions about your data or this policy? Write to us at <a href={SITE.emailHref}>{SITE.email}</a>.</p>
</LegalLayout>
